# The viewer build lands in ../iguana/viewer-dist, committed there so the
# iguana binary (and its published crate) embeds it. Rebuild it with
# `npm run build --workspace web-viewer` after changing web-viewer/.
#
# The wasm bundle is produced by `iguana generate --wasm` (here, copied from
# target/wasm/iggy) and dropped in alongside the viewer; it is not source.
public/manifest.json
public/wasm/
